      "text": "WHEREAS, the Board of Estimate on November 21, 1968, and the City Council on February 12, 1969, approved an amendment to the Capital Budget for construction of a consolidated passenger ship terminal on the North River between 46th and 50th Streets, which would require functional links to and provide potential waterfront amenity for the Midtown area;",
